                <invention-title lang="de">ROBOTERRASENMÄHERSYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUM TRANSPORT EINES ROBOTERRASENMÄHERS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE TONDEUSE À GAZON ROBOTIQUE ET PROCÉDÉ DE TRANSPORT D'UNE TONDEUSE À GAZON ROBOTIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ROBOTIC WORK TOOL SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR TRANSPORTING A ROBOTIC WORK TOOL BETWEEN DIFFERENT AREAS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A robotic lawnmower system system for avoiding trails from a robotic lawnmower (100) in a transit zone (300) in which the robotic lawnmower (100) is allowed to travel from a start point (320) to a goal point (330) along a travel path (310). The lawnmower system comprises at least one memory configured to store information about the transit zone (300), at least one robotic lawnmower (100) configured to travel along the travel path (310) and at least one controller for controlling operation of the robotic lawnmower (100). The controller is configured to receive, from the memory , information about the transit zone (300) and generate, based on the transit zone (300), the travel path (310) for the robotic lawnmower (100) from the start point (320) to the goal point (330). The generated travel path (310) is configured to differ from previously generated travel paths.</p>
            </abstract>
